From a0554fe7639f951105417493bfe33aeb4540d868 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ralf Lici <ralf@mandelbit.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 18:33:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/20] net: ipxlat: add IPv4/IPv6 header and transport
 translation

Rewrite IPv4 and IPv6 headers in place, map Fragment Headers and update
TCP and UDP checksums for ordinary, partial-checksum and GSO packets.

Signed-off-by: Ralf Lici <ralf@mandelbit.com>
