+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
+/*  IPXLAT - Stateless IP/ICMP Translation (SIIT) engine
+ *
+ *  Copyright (C) 2024- Alberto Leiva Popper <ydahhrk@gmail.com>
